T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AlephOneCategorical}_L(T)\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Complete}(T)\n\\land\n\\operatorname{Categorical}_{\\aleph_1}(T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The definition concerns models of cardinality exactly <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>.  Morley's\ncategoricity-transfer theorem may yield uniqueness in all uncountable\ncardinalities under its hypotheses, but that is not the definition of\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>-categoricity.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-theory-properties]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-categoricity","status":"resolved","id":"cd3e154dc1b3bfce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-categoricity]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-theory-properties","status":"resolved","id":"bd7acd1192e46962","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Complete}$ (theory-completeness predicate, see [[17-df-theory-properties]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-categoricity","status":"resolved","id":"cd3e154dc1b3bfce","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\opera